{"title":"Luna Wing","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Luna Moth, Moonfane Moth, Great Luna Moth, Selene, Mother Of Moths, Rimewing +1 more</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"moonfane-moth\" title=\"Moonfane Moth - dropped it in 118 of 172 looted corpses (1/1.5)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/ac436496b9298e59bc40.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Moonfane Moth</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.5<br>×1–8</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"luna-moth\" title=\"Luna Moth - dropped it in 197 of 289 looted corpses (1/1.5)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/a3b4c44c77eff00cb465.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Luna Moth</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.5<br>×1–9</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"great-luna-moth\" title=\"Great Luna Moth - dropped it in 50 of 75 looted corpses (1/1.5)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/1db74296e1355f07b474.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Great Luna Moth</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.5<br>×1–7</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"rimewing\" title=\"Rimewing - dropped it in 2 of 4 looted corpses (1/2)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/8c3a3c351144b327cb83.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Rimewing</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2<br>×4–5</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+2 more\">+2 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"moon-mother\" title=\"Selene, Mother Of Moths - dropped it in 2 of 4 looted corpses (1/2)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/7c86cf4529db3a6a02f0.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Selene, Mother Of Moths</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"lantern-eater\" title=\"The Lantern Eater - dropped it in 1 of 4 looted corpses (1/4)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/c92787d8673dbae51c75.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">The Lantern Eater</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/4<br>×3</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"luna-wing\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/9dfc6bd97d5a343b2a88.svg\" alt=\"Luna Wing\"></div><h3>Luna Wing</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>6 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/29/2026, 7:09:31 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}